<li>处理组件<code v-pre>processComponent(n1, n2, container, anchor)</code><br>
如果<code v-pre>n1</code>是空的话说明是第一次渲染,调用<code v-pre>mountComponent</code>
如果<code v-pre>n1</code>不为空的话说明需要更新组件,调用<code v-pre>updateComponent</code></li>
<li>创建组件<code v-pre>mountComponent(vnode, container, anchor)</code></li>
